{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08484","headline":"送张秀才从军 · 李白","name":"送张秀才从军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六驳食猛虎，耻从驽马羣。\n一朝长鸣去，矫若龙行云。\n壮士怀远略，志存解世纷。\n周粟犹不顾，齐珪安肯分。\n抱剑辞高堂，将投崔冠军。\n长策扫河洛，宁亲归汝坟。\n当令千古後，麟阁着奇勳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}